[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0214","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0214.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0550","title":"WU-FTPD 2.6.1 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"这是一个针对 wu-ftpd 2.6.1 的远程命令执行漏洞。该漏洞源于 FTP 服务器的 glob 函数（ftpglob）在处理特定的“~{\"”字符串时出现缺陷，攻击者可以构造恶意输入绕过验证直接执行系统命令。影响范围包括所有运行 wu-ftpd 2.6.1 的 FTP 服务器，攻击者无需身份验证即可远程触发，从网络连接开始，通过精心构造的参数触发堆溢出或直接执行命令，以达到完全控制服务器的目的。导致服务器被入侵、数据泄露或进一步横向移动。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 7.5，反映其网络可达性低、攻击复杂性低、无需认证、并可能引发局部完整性泄露和破坏。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0550"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-11-30T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:30Z","remediation":"升级 Wu-FTPD 服务到 2.6.2 或更高版本，从源代码重新编译以应用所有安全补丁并关闭危险的 glob 功能。编辑 /etc/inetd.conf 或ftp服务器的配置文件，禁用不必要的高危命令（如 CWD、PASSIVE 模式）并限制服务网络访问权限。如无法立即升级，可配置防火墙规则阻止对FTP端口的异常连接，并限制用户权限以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000442","http://download.immunix.org/ImmunixOS/7.0/updates/IMNX-2001-70-036-01","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100700363414799&w=2","http://www.caldera.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2001-041.0.txt","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2001-33.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-087","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/886083","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-090.php3","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2001_043_wuftpd_txt.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-157.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/82/180823","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3581","http://www1.itrc.hp.com/service/cki/docDisplay.do?docId=HPSBUX0107-162","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7611","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21161","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0550.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/4a0cf863db8d2032b534fdeb22ed679473499848/2001/CVE-2001-0550.json","https://github.com/mthcht/awesome-lists/blob/ec88907fa03ae5d9163ffc30448cd6735b4078ed/