ation advice. The product is likely no longer supported, so upgrading may not be an option. I should recommend:\n1. Upgrading to the latest version if available\n2. If the product is EOL/discontinued, recommend replacing it\n3. Network-level mitigations like input filtering or firewall rules\n\nLet me search for more information about this product and its currentstatus.Let me analyze the information I've gathered:\n\n1. CVE-2001-0932 affects Cooolsoft PowerFTP Server 2.03\n2. It's a buffer overflow via long commands that causes DoS and possibly RCE\n3. The vendor (Cooolsoft) appears to be defunct - this is a very old vulnerability from 2001\n4. The product is no longer maintained/supported\n\nSince this is an old vulnerability (2001) and the vendor is likely defunct, the remediation should focus on:\n- Upgrading to a newer version (if any exists)\n- Since the product is likely EOL/discontinued, the main recommendation would be to stop using PowerFTP Server and migrate to an alternative FTP server\n- Firewall/network-level mitigations\n\nLet me check if there's any information about the latest version of PowerFTP or if it's been discontinued.\n\nFrom the exploit-db page, the vulnerable app is PowerFTP Server 2.03. The exploit targets version 2.03. The product is from Cooolsoft which appears to be a long-defunct company.\n\nThe remediation should be practical and actionable. Since this is an ancient vulnerability with a defunct vendor, the best remediation is to discontinue use of PowerFTP Server and migrate to a maintained alternative.<value>Cooolsoft PowerFTP Server 已停止维护且厂商已不存在，建议立即停止使用 PowerFTP Server 2.03，迁移至仍受支持的 FTP 服务器软件（如 FileZilla Server 或 vsftpd）。如无法立即迁移，可在防火墙层面限制对 FTP 端口（21/TCP）的访问来源 IP，仅允许可信网络段连接。\"\"\"","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100698397818175&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3595","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7616","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21163","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2001/CVE-2001-0932.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/6695f20ae08803f774b618dbe76c2549e17160e7/2001/CVE-2001-0932.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/fbb83465db9f8eb048237338aeda5d9d7fa146a4/2001/CVE-2001-0932/README.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0932","https://github.com/diannaofengzi/POC/blob/14d504f7488db9229f6f02be54aab53e3cfee0dc/databases/2001/database/CVE-2001-0932/CVE-2001-0932-alt3kx.md","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2001.txt","https://github.com/0xT11/CVE-POC/blob/2b6f11c3712c0efb88ac3edeab3d0aafa1f7a090/2001/CVE-2001-0932.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/724a585dd64bbf0d8e6760dd16b808140e9a0dd8/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-qp3r-m36w-7mr6/GHSA-qp3r-m36w-7mr6.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0932.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0932.json","https://github.com/alt3kx/CVE-2001-0932"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0422.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0350","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0350.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0935","title":"华盛顿大学 wu-ftpd 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"wu-ftpd 2.6.0 及更早版本存在安全漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过网络向目标 FTP 服务发送特制数据包触发该漏洞。该漏洞与 CVE-2001-0550 中描述的 ftpglob 错误无关，攻击者无需任何凭据即可利用，成功利用后可导致部分机密性、完整性和可用性损失，可能造成远程命令执行或拒绝服务。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0935"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-11-28T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:15Z","remediation":"建议立即将 wu-ftpd 升级至 2.6.1 或更高版本，上游修复通过更新 glob.c 文件消除了缓冲区溢出风险。临时缓解措施：在防火墙层面限制 FTP 服务仅对可信来源开放，禁用不必要的匿名访问及 SITE EXEC 等危险命令；长期建议迁移至持续维护的 FTPServer（如 vsftpd 或 proftpd），避免继续使用已多年无安全更新的 wu-ftpd。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2001_043_wuftpd_txt.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2001/CVE-2001-0935.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3dd627d6b90f81690ae15e5d5fb02176cc79caf3/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0935.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0935","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cc202af7c41ce1218ba7619eda84142fd5c7f1cf/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0935.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0935.md","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/wu_ftpd_glob.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0935.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151800_151900.json","https://github.com/r3p3r/cve-search/blob/4ecae17dde3ae5f3ee873c1f01faa3cc8769b85d/sbin/db_mgmt_vendorstatements.py"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0350.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0396","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0396.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0875","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 文件下载安全警告绕过漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5.5 与 6.0 存在文件下载安全警告绕过漏洞。远程攻击者可构造特制网页或下载链接，使“文件下载”对话框中显示的文件名或扩展名被错误呈现，从而误导用户将危险文件（如可执行程序）误认为安全类型并确认下载执行。该漏洞无需身份认证，攻击条件为网络可达且用户需主动确认下载；成功利用可导致恶意代码在用户系统中运行，造成信息泄露、篡改或可用性受损。CVSS 评分为 7.5，危害等级为高危，主要影响使用 IE 5.5/6.0 的 Windows 客户端环境。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0875"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-11-26T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:08Z","remediation":"立即安装微软安全公告 MS01-058 对应的累积补丁 KB313675，下载地址为 https://www.microsoft.com/windows/ie/downloads/critical/Q313675/default.asp。IE 5.5 用户安装后需重启浏览器，IE 6.0 Gold 用户可直接安装。如暂时无法打补丁，可在 IE 安全设置中将 Internet 区域和 Intranet 区域的「文件下载」功能禁用，作为临时缓解措施。长远建议升级至 IE 5.5 SP3 或 IE 6 SP1，该补丁已集成于这两个服务包中。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/245594","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3597","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2001/ms01-058","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7636","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A1014","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/641","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d2be4eb036a20db5be632f5ca0ba66a631c4d156/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0875.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0875","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/beabc13489602b94b6c532f1aa3931e9e9fc2bc0/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0875.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f59a7fbf5b47ecd49b181f13f4091ea609ec99d4/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0875.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/smb_nt_ms02-005.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/458762a518138a26e597ac195eb82ce6c30238eb/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6q67-2q8f-xvf4/GHSA-6q67-2q8f-xvf4.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2001-0875.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob