nt.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0411.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0411.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0409","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0409.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0909","title":"Microsoft Windows XP Help Center HCP URI 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows XP 的帮助中心程序 helpctr.exe 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过发送包含超长 hcp: URI 的特制请求，触发 helpctr.exe 中的缓冲区溢出，从而在目标系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Windows XP 操作系统，CVSS 评分为 7.5，属于高危级别。攻击条件宽松，仅需向目标发送恶意构造的 hcp 协议链接即可触发利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0909"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-11-21T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:12Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS02-060 对应的更新补丁，或升级至 Windows XP Service Pack 1 (SP1) 及以上版本。如无法安装补丁，可通过命令行运行 `regsvr32 /u %windir%\\pchealth\\helpctr\\binaries\\helpctr.exe` 注销 helpctr.exe 组件，或删除注册表中 `HKEY_CLASSES_ROOT\\hcp` 协议处理项作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100638955422011&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6802","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7605","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/22232","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c7415a52c8c7c49b12758f6cb68d7d41d1190b12/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0909.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0909","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1b90054999de26e10cbd417a0bad0a4c95c3a80e/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0909.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03565a27475d500737670f7247b6cadb2e7c3d33/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0909.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c94c1772ba718b7f105ed32361c896b35042b2b3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-c64x-2qg4-rpqq/GHSA-c64x-2qg4-rpqq.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0909.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151700_151800.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--b78cd9d1-2a13-43bd-a1d9-fe346abc1009.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0409.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0409.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0409.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0404","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0404.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0900","title":"Menalto Gallery modules.php 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Gallery 1.1 和 1.2 版本的 modules.php 文件存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过在 include 参数中注入 ../ 路径序列，突破 Web 根目录限制，读取服务器上的任意敏感文件（如配置文件或系统文件）。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，攻击条件宽松，只要目标运行受影响版本的 Gallery 并暴露 HTTP 服务即可触发。攻击者仅需发送包含恶意路径的 HTTP 请求，即可实现任意文件读取，造成敏感信息泄露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0900"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-11-18T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:11Z","remediation":"立即将 Gallery 升级至 1.2.3 或更高版本，该版本已修复 modules.php 中 include 参数未过滤目录遍历序列的问题。如暂时无法升级，可在 Web 服务器（如 Apache）配置中添加 rewrite 规则或 PHP 配置 open_basedir 限制，禁止通过 URL 访问 /etc/passwd 等系统敏感文件，并手动审查 modules.php 中对 include 参数的处理逻辑，确保不接受 ../../ 类路径序列。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100619599000590&w=2","http://www.menalto.com/projects/gallery/article.php?sid=33&mode=&order=","http://www.osvdb.org/677","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3554","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7580","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21157","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e2b7e39540f8003a5fc1c3ce83959dcdba6671a4/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0900.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0900","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a62a80fdc2396b876bbf0b9654bdb65410ca206f/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0900.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/17761d0bb7d0c679e07e3a6bd812f9ec07c3dd92/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0900.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c94c1772ba718b7f105ed32361c896b35042b2b3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-q7q6-r66q-5684/GHSA-q7q6-r66q-5684.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/php_nuke_galleryaddon.nasl","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2001-0900.md","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/php_nuke_installed.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0900.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151700_151800.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0404.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0402","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0402.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0899","title":"PHP-Nuke Network Tool 0.2 Addon 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"PHP-Nuke 的 Network Tools 0.2 插件存在命令注入漏洞。该组件未对用户传入的 $hostinput 变量进行充分过滤，远程攻击者可在无需身份认证的情况下，向相关网络诊断功能注入 shell 元字符（如分号、管道符等），使输入被拼接进系统命令并在服务器端执行任意操作系统命令。漏洞影响安装了 Network Tools 0.2 插件的 PHP-Nuke 站点，可导致信息泄露、文件篡改乃至主机被完全控制。CVSS 评分为 7.5，危害等级为高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0899"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-11-16T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:11Z","remediation":"立即卸载或禁用 PHP-Nuke 的 Network Tool 0.2 插件模块；若必须保留，在处理 $hostinput 的 PHP 代码中使用 escapeshellcmd() 过滤 shell 元字符（如 ; & | ` $ 等）后再传给 ping/nmap/traceroute，或升级到已修复该输入校验问题的后续版本，并限制仅管理员可访问该网络工具页面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100593523104176&w=2","http://phpnukerz.org/modules.php?name=Downloads&d_op=viewsdownload&sid=32","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7578","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21155","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/24762ffc4408618d0c62379d258b248e81056dc1/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0899.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0899","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/93ebbe91f1db0ecb2b0cbd102096a8fe577f8004/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0899.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3b0c45471d4a4c3513d56ab2afeeb30c8e072362/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0899.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c94c1772ba718b7f105ed32361c896b35042b2b3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-q3wg-37xx-vgfv/GHSA-q3wg-37xx-vgfv.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/php_nuke_installed.nasl","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2001-0899.md","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/nettools_cmd_exec.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0899.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0402.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0400","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0400.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0898","title":"Opera 浏览器 同源策略绕过信息泄露漏洞","description":"Opera 浏览器 6.0 及更早版本存在同源策略绕过漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可构造包含恶意 JavaScript 代码的网页，利用 setTimeout 方法在目标域名新窗口打开后访问其中数据，或通过 about:cache 页面读取缓存信息，从而窃取其他域名的敏感信息，包括用户 Cookie 和网站链接等。该漏洞只需用户使用受影响版本的 Opera 浏览器访问恶意页面即可触发，无需任何权限或交互操作，攻击者可借此实施会话劫持、隐私信息窃取等进一步攻击行为。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0898"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-11-15T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:11Z","remediation":"建议立即升级至 Opera 7.0 或更高版本，该版本修复了同源策略绕过漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在浏览器设置中禁用 JavaScript 作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100586079932284&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100588139312696&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7567.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3553","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21156","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/dbab824db2d42b734971c1b87553018066aa35d2/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0898.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0898","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/beabc13489602b94b6c532f1aa3931e9e9fc2bc0/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0898.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e90b2f048f8d5dc2c03ffbfc9a042a055738ffe6/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0898.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c94c1772ba718b7f105ed32361c896b35042b2b3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gh5x-cpm6-9f9c/GHSA-gh5x-cpm6-9f9c.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0898.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151700_151800.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--bd661a09-eee4-43d0-bd9d-2fa7a3fd9733.json","https://github.com/kookaip/PhD-ICSE2023-PrivacyVulnerabilities/blob/f07e7ceba63e856fe3d9dd40cee793b0ef452153/replication-package/data/7-cve-coder2.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0400.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0344","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0344.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0894","title":"Postfix SMTP服务器内存耗尽拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Postfix SMTP 服务器在特定配置下（当 SMTP 错误导致会话终止时向邮政管理员发送邮件）存在漏洞。攻击者可通过生成大量 SMTP 错误，迫使 SMTP 会话日志过大增长，导致服务器内存耗尽，引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Wietse Venema 的 Postfix 1999-09-06/1999-12-31/2000-02-28 版本，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可轻易触发。通过精心构造的 SMTP 消息序列，攻击者可以持续消耗服务器资源，使得邮件服务无法正常响应，最终导致系统瘫痪。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0894"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-11-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:10Z","remediation":"升级 Postfix 至 20010228-pl07 或更高版本（如 2.0.0 及以上稳定版）。若暂时无法升级，请在 main.cf 中设置 `notify_classes = bounce, 2bounce, delay, policy, protocol, resource, software` 移除 `smtpd` 类以禁用 SMTP 错误向 postmaster 发送邮件；同时在 main.cf 设置 `smtpd_error_sleep_time = 1s`、`smtpd_soft_error_limit = 3`、`smtpd_hard_error_limit = 10` 限制错误次数，并配置防火墙限制 SMTP 端口（25/587）仅允许可信 IP 访问作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000439","http://frontal2.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2001:089","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100584160110303&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-093","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-156.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3544","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7568","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2191d577d2d643f301487a89dd6359b1113a07b9/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0894.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0894","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0894.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/80dda50d8d5f7811125252929942fe793daf4c0a/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0894.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-093.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/292f77a8e015ead047ef178a4e7ea4de6f3945c3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4jcc-3cc2-c846/GHSA-4jcc-3cc2-c846.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2001-0894.md","https://github.com/muyuruhua/reproduce/blob/cefab9454115cd466ed14d9c51296ad2c168cafc/exim/README.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2001/dsa-093.data"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0344.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0506","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0506.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1388","title":"Netfilter iptables 速率限制转换不准确漏洞","description":"iptables 1.2.4 之前版本存在速率限制转换不准确漏洞，管理员在命令行指定的速率限制参数未能被正确转换为内核规则，导致实际流量控制偏离预期值。攻击者或普通用户可利用此缺陷绕过流量限制策略，发送超出或低于预期的网络流量，造成拒绝服务或规则失效。该漏洞影响所有使用 iptables 进行流量整形的 Linux 系统，攻击向量为网络远程利用，无需身份认证，攻击复杂度低，主要影响可用性（CVSS 5.0，AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:P），属于资源管理错误（CWE-770）类型。升级至 iptables 1.2.4 或更高版本可修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1388"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-11-05T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:10Z","remediation":"升级 iptables 至 1.2.4 或更高版本，该版本修复了命令行速率限制参数转换不准确的问题。如无法升级，可在 iptables 规则中避免使用 `-m limit` 模块的速率限制功能，改用应用层限流或硬件防火墙进行流量控制。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://bugzilla.redhat.com/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=53325","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2001-144.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3fc46d7716e9a0dd9635d13e2bff8fffb122a860/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1388.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1388","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/5ea14f17ec38fb7850c23056beec64877fabc5b1/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1388.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/73cd39be077fdbedc5ca2ea7e2723723d25285cc/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1388.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2wqm-g7m4-4gj8/GHSA-2wqm-g7m4-4gj8.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88642/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1388.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151800_151900.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2001.tsv","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1388.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0506.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0504","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0504.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1387","title":"Netfilter iptables 信息泄露漏洞","description":"iptables 1.2.4 之前版本中的 iptables-save 工具存在信息泄露漏洞。当管理员配置 \"--reject-with icmp-host-prohibited\" 拒绝规则时，iptables-save 会错误地将其记录为 \"--reject-with tcp-reset\"，导致 iptables 实际生成的响应与管理员预期不符。攻击者可通过观察目标系统对不同端口的响应差异，推断出防火墙规则的存在与配置细节，从而获取网络拓扑和访问控制策略等敏感信息。该漏洞需要本地访问权限，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1387"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-11-05T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:10Z","remediation":"升级 iptables 至 1.2.4 或更高版本，该版本已修复 iptables-save 规则记录错误问题。如无法升级，请手动检查并修正 iptables 规则集中所有 `--reject-with` 参数，确保 `icmp-host-prohibited` 规则未被错误保存为 `tcp-reset`，并在保存规则后使用 `iptables -L -n` 验证规则完整性。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://bugzilla.redhat.com/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=50500","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2001-144.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3fc46d7716e9a0dd9635d13e2bff8fffb122a860/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1387.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1387","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/5ea14f17ec38fb7850c23056beec64877fabc5b1/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1387.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/73cd39be077fdbedc5ca2ea7e2723723d25285cc/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1387.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2wcp-prmg-9pr7/GHSA-2wcp-prmg-9pr7.json","https://github.com/CWE-CAPEC/REST-API-wg/blob/5a8974308ef38e8ee4979e4a29b3b3a22c647822/json_repo/W/449.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88657/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_500_600.json","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-204.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2001.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0504.toml"}]